chunks.text:
[Nights]
{relentless dark horror pulse: distorted 808 sub bass, pounding toms, trap hi-hats in half-time}
{a creepy detuned music-box melody on top, a dissonant string ostinato}
{the tension rises non-stop and hits harder every 8 bars}

[Reveal]
{one second of dead silence, then a colossal horror explosion}
{huge deep brass blasts, a wordless dark choir, distorted drums, screeching strings, maximum terror}
{a first massive hit at 5.6 seconds, a brutal hit at 12.2 seconds, then a ringing aftermath}

[Fight back]
{aggressive epic hybrid trailer: huge taiko and trap drums at 140 bpm, distorted bass}
{soaring defiant strings and a wordless choir, unstoppable and triumphant}
{a one-second drop-out at 16.6 seconds, then it slams back harder}

[Weeks later]
{sudden calm: a fragile warm solo piano phrase}
{at 4.6 seconds a creeping dark drone and the detuned music-box melody return}
{one final massive hit at 8.4 seconds, then a low ringing drone to the end}
